[PrintTextModified Text:橘雪莉就是杀害远野汉娜的凶手。|#0103Adv27_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个令人窒息的现实，<br>正是艾玛所揭示的真相。|#0103Adv27_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然，这场魔女审判中，<br>雪莉获得了最高的票数。|#0103Adv27_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,40 AppearanceAndTransition:14_1 SubId:Middle
