[PrintTextModified Text:还以为成功实施完美犯罪了，<br>可结果还是被识破了呢，真遗憾。|#0103Adv27_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，<br>我原以为只有艾玛能够看穿我是凶手呢。|#0103Adv27_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毕竟你在之前的审判中一直表现得很出色。|#0103Adv27_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:不愧是艾玛，<br>我彻底输了！|#0103Adv27_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉带着笑容，<br>轻描淡写地说道。|#0103Adv27_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛眼含泪水，<br>难以置信地瞪视着雪莉。|#0103Adv27_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

