[PrintTextModified Text:啊？？？？<br>你的脑子真的坏掉了吗？|#0103Adv27_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哪个世界会有人去杀自己的朋友？<br>|#0103Adv27_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然也有因爱生恨的案例……<br>|#0103Adv27_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但雪莉的行为太过理性冷酷，<br>应该不算那种情况呢。|#0103Adv27_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被你杀害的远野一定很恨你。<br>在场的樱羽和冰上也是。|#0103Adv27_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这里已经没有任何人会把你当作朋友了！<br>|#0103Adv27_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即便如此，我也认为我们是朋友！|#0103Adv27_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露在一旁失声痛哭。<br>艾玛则低着头，肩膀不住地颤抖着。|#0103Adv27_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是在求饶吗！？<br>还是想装作好人再死！？|#0103Adv27_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:能不能考虑一下她们两个的感受啊！|#0103Adv27_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一个朋友被人杀害，<br>还必须亲手将另一个朋友送上处刑台！|#0103Adv27_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在你总该明白<br>你给她们带来了多大的伤害了吧！|#0103Adv27_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别再挣扎了，<br>你就坏人当到底，老老实实受死吧！|#0103Adv27_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、梅露露，你们不必再听她说了。<br>她根本就不明白她伤害了你们，<br>也根本不知道什么叫负罪感。|#0103Adv27_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个……也许你说得对。|#0103Adv27_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉耸了耸肩，<br>很干脆地承认了。|#0103Adv27_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:坦白说，我确实无法理解他人的感受，<br>也没有所谓的罪恶感。|#0103Adv27_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果我一直强调友情<br>反而会令大家更加痛苦的话，那我很抱歉。|#0103Adv27_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但即便如此，在我心中，汉娜、<br>梅露露还有艾玛，<br>至今依然是我的朋友。|#0103Adv27_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（够了，我不想再听了……）|#0103Adv27_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我不想更加憎恨雪莉了……！）<br>|#0103Adv27_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而雪莉仍在诉说。|#0103Adv27_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即便被荆棘束缚，即将被处决，她依然在诉说。|#0103Adv27_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么会变成这样呢。<br>啊——|#0103Adv27_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我曾经杀过人。<br>大概从那时起，我的心就已经坏掉了吧……|#0103Adv27_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:——艾玛等人<br>被强行拖入了橘雪莉的内心禁忌。|#0103Adv27_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如同被无形的锁链拖入深渊般，<br>被迫窥视那最深处的黑暗。|#0103Adv27_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

