@Wait WaitMode:0.9

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_43_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:对于杀害汉娜，<br>我究竟需要有什么感受呢？|#0103Adv27_Sherry015| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:后悔？罪恶感？悲伤？愤怒？<br>我亲手杀的人，为什么我还要感受这些呢？|#0103Adv27_Sherry016| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这些感情又有什么意义呢？<br>又不能让汉娜复活。|#0103Adv27_Sherry017| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @char Margo.Normal1 pos:50

[PrintTextModified Text:……我能理解你的想法。<br>但这就是人啊。|#0103Adv27_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果连哀悼之心都没有的话……那已经不能称之为人了。|#0103Adv27_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @char Sherry.Normal1 pos:50

[PrintTextModified Text:说得对呢，<br>毕竟我已经被选为魔女了。|#0103Adv27_Sherry018| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:——够了，我不想再听了！<br>快点结束这一切吧！|#0103Adv27_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛抬起头，直勾勾盯着雪莉。|#0103Adv27_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @char Ema.Cry1 pos:50

[PrintTextModified Text:快点——从我眼前消失！|#0103Adv27_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她流着泪，发自内心地嘶喊。|#0103Adv27_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
; @char Sherry.Pensive1 pos:50

[PrintTextModified Text:你说得对……<br>请开始行刑吧。|#0103Adv27_Sherry019| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉露出略带寂寞的微笑。<br>|#0103Adv27_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:火焰从雪莉脚下升腾而起，<br>仿佛映照着艾玛的憎恨。|#0103Adv27_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 燃え上がる音
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_6_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:50_1 SubId:Middle

; ＠備考◆痛そうに

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0103Adv27_Sherry020| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在火焰的炙烤下，<br>雪莉痛苦地扭曲着脸庞。|#0103Adv27_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对在场的少女们而言，<br>这场火刑的景象实在是过于残酷。|#0103Adv27_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:几乎所有少女都移开了视线，<br>但皮肤焦灼的气味却无可避免地钻入鼻腔。|#0103Adv27_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……不对劲……|#0103Adv27_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露带着茫然的神色，<br>轻声说道。|#0103Adv27_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:50_2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:唔唔唔唔唔……唔唔唔唔……<br>好热啊……这个，真的，好痛啊……|#0103Adv27_Sherry021| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不对劲！<br>雪莉小姐的身体完全没有再生……！|#0103Adv27_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……？|#0103Adv27_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:起初，<br>艾玛未能理解梅露露这句话背后的含义。|#0103Adv27_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉的膝盖以下的皮肤<br>都被烧得翻卷了起来。|#0103Adv27_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在熊熊燃烧的火焰间隙中，<br>那令人痛心的景象清晰可见。|#0103Adv27_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——艾玛又花了几秒钟，<br>才真正明白这意味着什么。|#0103Adv27_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉根本就不是魔女……|#0103Adv27_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尚未魔女化的少女，其肉体并非不死之身。|#0103Adv27_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那、那雪莉她岂不是，<br>真的会死去！？|#0103Adv27_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……应该是这样吧。|#0103Adv27_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就连一向冷静的玛格也动摇了，<br>将视线从处刑台移向了别处。|#0103Adv27_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们现在正在真正地<br>亲手处死一位少女。|#0103Adv27_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:竟然在没有变成魔女的情况下就杀人了……<br>这家伙果然脑子有问题…|#0103Adv27_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这、这不也、也、挺挺好的？<br>反正她就是凶手不是吗？|#0103Adv27_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个事实是不会改变的，<br>所以她这种人就是该死啊！|#0103Adv27_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可的声音也变得颤抖起来。|#0103Adv27_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就不能停止处刑吗！？<br>这……这根本就不对！！|#0103Adv27_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉可是会死的！！|#0103Adv27_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和梅露露冲向处刑台，<br>却被看守拦住了去路。|#0103Adv27_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经阻止不了了……！|#0103Adv27_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:50_3 SubId:Front
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills,Stills-Middle,Stills-Forefront,MainBackground Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:处刑台上，<br>雪莉不断地哭泣着。|#0103Adv27_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:本以为那是出于难忍的疼痛和灼热的泪水，<br>但雪莉的低语却对此作出了否定。|#0103Adv27_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-45 Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,-40 AppearanceAndTransition:50_3 SubId:Forefront

[PrintTextModified Text:我没有后悔，<br>也没有罪恶感……|#0103Adv27_Sherry022| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，我不该被处刑的……<br>我不能死。|#0103Adv27_Sherry023| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我违背了约定。<br>只有这一点，真的很抱歉……|#0103Adv27_Sherry024| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:约、定……？|#0103Adv27_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我这副模样，<br>一定会被汉娜臭骂一顿。|#0103Adv27_Sherry025| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真想被她称赞哪怕一次啊。|#0103Adv27_Sherry026| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉的眼神望向了并非此处的远方。|#0103Adv27_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

