@SpawnBlur ActorId:Stills Intensity:0.1 FadeDuration:0.3
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:那是一片熟悉的蓝天。|#0103Adv27_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_42_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:记忆中的那天，她紧贴着汉娜的背，<br>两人一同骑着扫帚翱翔于天际。|#0103Adv27_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:望着艾玛和梅露露的身影渐渐远去，<br>雪莉察觉到了异样。|#0103Adv27_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,88 AppearanceAndTransition:40_1 SubId:Middle
@SpawnBlur ActorId:Stills-Middle Intensity:0.1 FadeDuration:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:……汉娜，<br>我们以前有飞得这么高，这么久吗？|#0103Adv27_Sherry027| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的背脊猛然一僵。|#0103Adv27_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:最终，她像是认命了一般，<br>深深地，深深地叹了口气。|#0103Adv27_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我想，<br>我已经快要变成魔女了。|#0103Adv27_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔法已经变得这么强了，<br>恐怕留给我的时间不多了。|#0103Adv27_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我说，雪莉。|#0103Adv27_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在我变成魔女之前，<br>能请你杀了我吗？|#0103Adv27_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……你是在开玩笑吧？|#0103Adv27_Sherry028| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，你不用当真。<br>就当是假设好了。|#0103Adv27_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但我真的不想变成魔女。|#0103Adv27_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不想变成魔女，<br>去憎恨他人，心怀杀意。|#0103Adv27_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不想心甘情愿地接受<br>这座监牢为我们编排的既定命运。|#0103Adv27_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果躲不开成为魔女的宿命，<br>至少我想要反抗一下。|#0103Adv27_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果我杀了汉娜，<br>我就会被当作魔女处决了。|#0103Adv27_Sherry029| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我才只告诉你一个人啊。|#0103Adv27_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，太过分了！<br>意思是我被处刑就没关系吗！？|#0103Adv27_Sherry030| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎，不对啦！<br>要做就做完美犯罪啊！|#0103Adv27_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:完美犯罪？这词真让人热血沸腾呢！|#0103Adv27_Sherry031| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你一定能做到的吧？你可是名侦探啊。|#0103Adv27_Hanna012| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然只是假设。但是，如果……<br>如果那一天真的来临的话。|#0103Adv27_Hanna013| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:约好了哦，你一定不能死。|#0103Adv27_Hanna014| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然啦！包在我身上！|#0103Adv27_Sherry032| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

