[PrintTextModified Text:被火焰灼烧的雪莉，<br>在痛苦的呻吟间断断续续地说出了真相。|#0103Adv27_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其中，存在着真正的感情。|#0103Adv27_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正因为是朋友，才不得不杀害对方——这就是真相。|#0103Adv27_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……对不起，我要、死了。|#0103Adv27_Sherry033| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……笨、<br>笨蛋！！|#0103Adv27_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，<br>你的心根本就没有坏掉啊！|#0103Adv27_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你是为了朋友，<br>才做了那些不愿意做的事情啊！！|#0103Adv27_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一切、一切都是为了朋友啊！！|#0103Adv27_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但一切都太迟了。<br>处刑已无法停止，雪莉的生命正在消逝。|#0103Adv27_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛被看守拦住，只能徒劳地挣扎。<br>除了无助的挣扎，什么都做不了。|#0103Adv27_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:50_3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:快停止处刑啊！<br>雪莉根本就不是魔女！|#0103Adv27_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她会消失的！！|#0103Adv27_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，说什么让你消失的话！<br>对不起说了那么过分的话……|#0103Adv27_Ema027| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉！雪莉！<br>雪莉！！|#0103Adv27_Ema028| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别哭啊，艾玛。|#0103Adv27_Sherry034| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这难以想像的痛苦与煎熬中。<br>|#0103Adv27_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-45 Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,-40 AppearanceAndTransition:50_3 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉望向艾玛，展露出温柔的微笑。|#0103Adv27_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我终于证明给大家看了吧？|#0103Adv27_Sherry035| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们是真正的朋友啊。|#0103Adv27_Sherry036| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:永远都是好朋友！|#0103Adv27_Sherry037| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

