[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊啊啊啊啊……啊……|#0103Adv27_Ema029| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛喉咙里发出撕心裂肺的悲鸣。|#0103Adv27_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉的身体没有复活，<br>在烈火中渐渐化为灰烬。|#0103Adv27_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她没有变成魔女的残骸。<br>她被烧死了。|#0103Adv27_Narrative080| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:由于是烧死，<br>雪莉未能打开永恒囚牢的大门。|#0103Adv27_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

